4d1f1db4-2bd5-4177-b926-818bbdca7d71,"App is now bombarded with ads, making it feel cheap and more of a fraudulent website. The website really has lost its class. They charge you for doing cash on delivery. Ads pop up after every single tap, which is frustrating as one can not look at what he wants to buy when being bombarded with useless ads. But I have to give props to their customer service and their delivery as a whole.",3,37,1722917166000,,,Daraz Online Shopping App
fcf9b1e3-2a25-4912-a71a-1b2bbdaad249,The search is by far the most atrocious aspect of this app (or daraz in general; its website on PC isn't any better either) - I can hardly find what I'm looking for and search results bring up loads of completely unrelated products that I have to comb through to find the ones I need. Categories aren't comprehensive - especially for tech-related products. The app is sorely lacking a dark mode. And the volume of promotional notifications it sends everyday is annoying at best.,1,142,1716157841000,,,Daraz Online Shopping App
2e9aca7c-5100-4ac5-9b6e-dc90411799d1,"I recently had an experience with your services and would like to provide some constructive feedback. While attempting to make a purchase, I encountered challenges with the pricing, which seemed to differ from the advertised rates. Unfortunately, despite my efforts, I was unable to proceed with the purchase, even when exploring the option of collecting from the warehouse.",1,2,1708590397000,,,Daraz Online Shopping App
7ea9cf68-057a-4cfa-a61c-c8cecb329aed,"Too much ads in the notification. And there is no option to disable the ad notifications. Only option is from the device's system settings. Where it disables over all notification from the app including delivery notification and chat messages from stores. Annoying as hell. Daraz should fix. I don't want offers notifications, when i want to buy something with offers, ill open the app. I don't want to know about your offers and deals ever 30 minutes.",3,699,1657917580000,Hi Samrat! We are sorry that you faced an issue. Could you please share your issue details with us on https://daraz.formstack.com/forms/contact_us so that we can get in touch with you and resolve the issue?,1657981966000,Daraz Online Shopping App
e57b06f7-5b8e-4e80-807c-0d0a773a517d,"Update: The redesign is even uglier front end and still same buggy mess of a back-end. What were they thinking, lol. One of the worst designed apps. Full of bugs, poorly designed front end, slow and laggy. Intrusive advertising, inflated prices with ""discounts"". It's a complete scam package. Some products are good but overall full of rubbish items on perpetual sale.",1,313,1643231983000,"Hey Najam! We're always working hard to provide the best shopping experience. Daraz operates as a marketplace platform & all prices are assigned by the concerned vendors, we have a separate team who monitors all prices, if you see any abnormal prices, please report to us via live chat. However, we've noted your feedback & we'll surely look into it.",1640090366000,Daraz Online Shopping App
59ea6c51-0914-4a5a-80da-c295c59d46b0,"Orders and refund systems are good. But the app is bad! It takes 5-10 seconds for one order to load. The search function is incredibly bad. 90% of the results are unrelated to search query. There are numerous bugs in this app which ruins user experience. The worst of all is that when I search something I don't get what I am looking for. Say I'm search Samsung a51 protector. I'll get all samsung protectors, not just a51 protectors. Worst of all these bugs are present for years.",1,3004,1614718831000,"We're sorry for the issue, Wasif. Don't worry! We have highlighted this issue to our product team, and we'll get this fixed in no time. We got you covered! 💪",1606240352000,Daraz Online Shopping App
e4ad0c67-07ef-4107-8249-e674bbe7f88f,"An Overload of ads from Daraz. I installed it to try out the supposed discount for ordering through the app which was a sham. Again, the amount of notifications and ads you get when you have this app! Turns your personal phone into an ad machine. This is not to mention the poor service by Daraz who deliver only if they feel like it. Sometimes u pay for an order that never gets delivered. I never got a refund either after 26 follow-up calls over several hours. Wisdom: Always get Cash on Delivery",1,1,1597476914000,,,Daraz Online Shopping App
