3b15c12a-e01a-4728-8fe4-c0b675a8e510,"I had a great experience with my first two orders on the Daraz app—parcels arrived on time and the products were fantastic. However, I'm now facing issues. When I try to place more orders, I receive a ""limit exceeded"" message, despite removing vouchers and trying a new account. This problem prevents me from ordering my favorite items, which is very disappointing. I hope this issue gets resolved soon, as the initial service was excellent",3,55,1722680765000,,,Daraz Online Shopping App
